 son or watch the livestream.\n\nWHY IT MATTERS (GOVERNMENT RELATIONS):\nTh
 e first real test of the new council's spending priorities (public safety\
 , infrastructure\, housing). Read the draft budget before Dec. 3 and watch
  which departments and capital projects councillors push back on.\n\nDETAI
